      "hints": [
        "Evaluate $ff(x) = a - 2(a - 2x) = 4x - a$.",
        "Set $y = a - 2x$ and solve for $x = \\frac{a - y}{2}$ to find $f^{-1}(x)$."
      ],
      "walkthrough": [
        "Substitute $f(x)$ into itself to form $ff(x)$:\n$$ff(x) = a - 2(a - 2x) = a - 2a + 4x = 4x - a$$",
        "Set $y = a - 2x$ and rearrange to isolate $x$:\n$$2x = a - y \\implies x = \\frac{a - y}{2}$$\n$$f^{-1}(x) = \\frac{a - x}{2}$$"
      ],
